 render() based on purchase mode\" id=\"lineNote\">Every band runs the same Aero Fit app, coaching and Recovery scores. Buy one outright and add a membership any time.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"lineup-title serif text-[132px] leading-[0.86] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"lineup headline\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform-origin: 258.902px 170.273px; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">Five bands,<br data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\"/><span class=\"italic text-[#C8553D]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\">one app.</span></h2>\n<div class=\"lineup-meta flex flex-col items-end gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"lineup meta column\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\">\n<div class=\"h-12 p-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#EFEAE6] flex text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"buy mode toggle group\">\n<button class=\"modeBtn h-10 px-5 rounded-full transition bg-[#2A0B14] text-white\" data-act=\"mode\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-1\" data-mode=\"out\" data-name=\"buy outright toggle\" data-reason=\"active styling set by script\">Buy outright</button>\n<button class=\"modeBtn h-10 px-5 rounded-full transition hover:bg-[#F3EFEC]\" data-act=\"mode\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2-2\" data-mode=\"mem\" data-name=\"with membership toggle\" data-reason=\"active styling set by script\">With membership</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hidden items-center gap-2 text-[13px]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"plan selector row\" data-reason=\"rendered by script from plan state\" id=\"planRow\"><span class=\"text-[#6B4F57] mr-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"plan label text\">Plan</span><button class=\"h-9 px-3.5 rounded-full border transition border-[#E3DDDA] hover:bg-white\" data-act=\"plan\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"one year plan button\" data-plan=\"1\">One · $199/yr</