iv class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-5 gap-4 text-center\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"bar labels\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-1\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-1-1\">5</span>Lite</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-2\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-2-1\">7</span>Smart</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-3\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-3-1\">10</span>Pro</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-4\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-4-1\">6</span>Music</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-5\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-5-1\">14</span>Ultra</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- stage 02 -->\n<article class=\"stage absolute inset-0 bg-[#C8553D] text-[#FAF8F6]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"question 2 stage\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(100%, 0%) translate(4224px, 0px);\">\n<span class=\"absolute top-[108px] left-[56px] serif text-[340px] leading-[0.78] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"giant stage numeral\">02<span class=\"text-[60px] align-top ml-3 opacity-50 tracking-normal\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1-1\">/03</span></span>\n<div class=\"absolute right-[150px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"question body\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.28em] uppercase opacity-70\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"question count\">Question 2 of 3</p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-4 serif text-[72px] leading-[0.95] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"question headline\">How do you feel about wearing it overnight?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] max-w-[400px] opacity-85\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"question helper text\">Sleep stages need it on your wrist all night. Every gram counts at 3 am.</p>\n<div class=\"qopts mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-k=\"night\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"answer options\" data-reason=\"rendered by quiz script\"><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition bg-[#FAF8F6] text-[#2A0B14] border-[#FAF8F6]\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"night\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"lightest band answer option button\" data-v=\"light\">I want the lightest band</button><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition border-[#FAF8F6]/50 hover:bg-white/10\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"night\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"weight doesn't matter answer option button\" data-v=\"any\">Weight doesn't matter</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute left-[72px] bottom-[110px] flex items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3\" data-name=\"weight gauge group\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-[230px] h-[230px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"weight gauge\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n<circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"none\" r=\"42\" stroke=\"rgba(250,248,246,0.22)\" stroke-width=\"9\"></circle>\n<circle class=\"gauge-fg\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"none\" r=\"42\" stroke=\"#FAF8F6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"9\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#FAF8F6\" style=\"font-family:'Source Serif 4',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"50\" y=\"52\">18 g</text>\n<text fill=\"#FAF8F6\" opacity=\".7\" style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:6.5px;letter-spacing:1.4px\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"50\" y=\"65\">LIGHTEST BAND</text>\n</svg>\n<ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-[14px] w-[220px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"weight list\">\n<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/25 pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-1\"><span data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-1-1\">Lite</span><span class=\"serif text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-1-2\">18 g</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/25 pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-2\"><span data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-2-1\">Smart</span><span class=\"serif text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-2-2\">24 g</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/25 pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-3\"><span data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-3-1\">Pro</span><span class=\"serif text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-3-2\">27 g</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-white/25 pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-4\"><span data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-4-1\">Ultra</span><span class=\"serif text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2-4-2\">32 g</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- stage 03 -->\n<article class=\"stage absolute inset-0 bg-[#2A0B14] text-[#FAF8F6]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3\" data-name=\"question 3 stage\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(100%, 0%) translate(4224px, 0px);\">\n<span class=\"absolute top-[108px] left-[56px] serif text-[340px] leading-[0.78] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em] outline-text\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-1\" data-name=\"giant outlined stage numeral\" style=\"--sc:#F8F38A;--sw:2.5px\">03<span class=\"text-[60px] align-top ml-3 tracking-normal\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-1-1\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px #F8F38A\">/03</span></span>\n<div class=\"absolute right-[150px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-2\" data-name=\"question body\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.28em] uppercase opacity-70\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"question count\">Question 3 of 3</p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-4 serif text-[72px] leading-[0.95] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"question headline\">How would you like to pay?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] max-w-[400px] opacity-80\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-2-3\" data-name=\"question helper text\">Buy the band outright, or get it included with a 12-month membership.</p>\n<div class=\"qopts mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-k=\"pay\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-2-4\" data-name=\"answer options\" data-reason=\"rendered by quiz script\"><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition border-[#FAF8F6]/50 hover:bg-white/10\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"pay\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"buy outright answer option button\" data-v=\"out\">Buy the band outright</button><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition bg-[#FAF8F6] text-[#2A0B14] border-[#FAF8F6]\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"pay\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"include it in a membership answer option button\" data-v=\"mem\">Include it in a membership</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute left-[72px] bottom-[104px] w-[560px] rounded-[24px] bg-[#F8F38A] text-[#2A0B14] p-7\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3\" data-name=\"quiz result card\" data-reason=\"rendered by script from quiz answers\" id=\"quizResult\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3-1\"><div data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3-1-1\"><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.24em] uppercase opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3-1-1-1\">Start by comparing</p><p class=\"mt-2 serif text-[44px] leading-[0.95] font-medium tracking-[-0.02em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3-1-1-2\">Pro <span class=\"italic text-[#C8553D]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3-1-1-2-1\">and</span> Smart</p></div><div class=\"flex -space-x-4 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3-1-2\"><span class=\"w-[72px] h-[72px] rounded-full bg-white flex items-center justify-center ring-4 ring-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3-1-2-1\"><img alt=\"Aero Fit Pro\" class=\"w-14 h-14 object-contain mix-blend-multiply brightness-110\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-3-1-2-1-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kombai-assets.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/f9b46c42-